 ["THE MAP gives each prompt post one video with one song, the Prompt Doctor singing its intro and outro, and every episode opening on what came before. Episodes gather into named series with numbered episodes and matching thumbnails. Everything already written is scanned for posts, researchers gather what can be found no other way, tournaments, streams, guides and Discords, and each post is made into its video and published at the time the algorithm favours."
 "In January 2025, on Discord, “i'm going to sell a prompt that is a \"De-GPT'er\" you can put any text in it and it removes the AI telltale signs”.[[m:2025-01-19]] The next day the intro text named the Prompt Doctor, “Welcome to Dr. Prompt! I’m Dr. Thomas Ager, The Prompt Doctor, dedicated to perfecting your prompts”.[[m:2025-01-20#2]] On 21 January, “Let the prompt doctor help YOU get the most out of AI… WITHOUT becoming another generic AI account!”[[m:2025-01-21]]"
 "In summer 2025 the Prompt Doctor became how Smile would be taught. On a recording of 3 July, “Post on Hugging Face also the From Doctor Smile prompt language video.”[[m:2025-07-03#2]] The De-GPT document of 8 July was written in my name, “I’ve focused on developing prompt languages for the last 3 and a half years”,[[m:2025-07-08]] and Smile expert v0.3 called itself “a little free Prompt Doctor education for how to use (: Smile”.[[m:2025-07-30]] In November 2025 the Prompt Doctor was the SEO blog and mailing list that would bring people to Smile.[[m:2025-11-11]]"
 "In October 2026 the Prompt Doctor became an animated character. On 5 October, “we will create an AI avatar in stylistic style, animated style character who is relatable, writerly”, “prompt doctor is always animated”, and “whenever we see the prompt doctor his mouth needs to be moving. he must convey intellignet writerly doctorness.”[[m:2026-10-05]]"
 "So the Prompt Doctor moved from a De-GPT prompt I meant to sell in January 2025, through the teacher of Smile, to an animated avatar asked to tell every prompt post in October 2026, across {{moments}} moments and {{quotes}} quotes from {{first}} to {{last}}. The posts the Prompt Doctor tells are followed in [[t:offering]]."],
